{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-02_end","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-02","title":"善意背叛","storyCode":"12-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"cddc6d304b9648488e061ca977556acbd1c16630baa8071386b9d103f5f37d4a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来了，戈尔丁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱托......你比我想象的要了解我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你指哪些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伦蒂尼姆自救军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从哪里知道的消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请坐吧，戈尔丁女士，不用那么紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场战争并不发生在你我之间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，莱托中校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你是来干什么的，戈尔丁，你想拖延时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为你还有足够的筹码来与我谈条件，你以为你还能帮助你的那些朋友们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，戈尔丁女士，我以为你不会这么天真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们不久前刚聊过一次，莱托中校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，你不想让伦蒂尼姆变成下一个林贡斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看我们的周围吧，看看伦蒂尼姆正在奔向的那个深渊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你声称的“为自己选择的责任”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......戈尔丁。你难道不是批驳了我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们正在滑向那个深渊，战争开始了，战争曾经撕毁过高卢，我们的故乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次，它会撕毁什么呢？也许是萨卡兹们，也许是维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道这会是多么灾难性的后果，数十万，乃至数百万的人会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会流血，会死亡，会被这个时代埋葬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很清楚这一切！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我很清楚，但我不得不承认，是你开导了我，是你让我重新开始反思自己的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是让我逼问自己的内心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并没有那么在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们抛掉那些假惺惺的对“人类”或是“文明”的奢望吧，戈尔丁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在年轻时，我们曾经畅谈这些东西，我们满怀憧憬，赞美着历史上那些杰出的人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人啊，万物的灵长！我们的智慧与勇气让我们能区别于野兽，缔造这片大地上如此辉煌的奇迹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果从书本前抬起头来，把那些传奇故事一一与现实比对，我们就会发现，它们的结局何其相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相同的堕落，相同的腐朽，相同的自取灭亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们热忱赞颂的那些东西从一开始就不过是短暂的泡影呢？如果认为它们永恒存在的我们才是天真的一方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果毁灭，才是我们的本性呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前没有那么悲观，莱托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......悲观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁，你的用词很温柔，你居然只是称我的这些疯话为，“悲观”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为我会招来更尖刻的批评。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来......你也没有我以为的那么坚定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是开始试着面对现实，这很痛苦，但我只能这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，对于那天的对话，我可以给你一个新的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有为自己选择任何使命，戈尔丁女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不过是想......在接踵而至的毁灭中，活下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可悲又懦弱，渺小又单薄。但这确实是我得出的答案。我唯一能得出的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还能怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是个军人，你应该......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"服从命令？服从谁的命令？国王早就死了，议会被萨卡兹们掌控，每个大公爵都有自己的小算盘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成为一个英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"代价是什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我觉得这份代价......我担不起呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你进门的时候，你看过门口那个卫兵的眼睛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我手下那些军官，那些伙伴，那些迷茫的年轻人......提尔有五个孩子，萨珊的母亲已经瘫痪三年了，托特的弟弟得了矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......血魔会抽干他们的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屈服也无法避免这些发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起码......今天还没发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁，依我个人的角度，我也希望你活下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从根本上，我们或许是一类人。只是我终于决定放弃，而你还在坚持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与你，绝不相同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你问我，伦蒂尼姆自救军的情报从何而来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我回答你，从一个懦弱的老师那里得来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你自己，戈尔丁，你的那些纰漏，那些因胆怯和畏惧留下的痕迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情报工作并不适合多愁善感的人，你从一开始就知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不会的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的通讯已经响了很久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹突袭......卡登区的安全屋......我们......他们的部队......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奥克特里格区的安全屋......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，听得见吗，玛格纳区的安全屋正在遭受......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈尔丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈尔丁，他们因你而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把他们推进火坑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你的“战斗”所带来的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为此哀悼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的人很多，装备很精良，配合也很完美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵做不到这些，这是正规军的精锐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们每一个人，都是从千百次战斗中爬出来的嗜血机器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你给老子滚开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因陀罗，小心后面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样不是办法，我们正在陷入被动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去定位这支小队的指挥官。阿米娅，保持阵型，别停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，巷子另一头也有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟紧我，博士，我们冲过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你听见了吗？有个声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心那些源石技艺！冲过这片危险地带！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，抓紧我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"听那个声音的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们只能赌一把。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最烦被人摆布！嘁，好吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的，那是面墙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是某种幻术？冲进去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老子最讨厌躲躲藏藏的家伙，滚出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，滚出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，站在我身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......阿勒黛背后的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会说第二遍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下你的锤子吧，殿下，你这是白费力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为一位某种意义上的“王储”，你应该更有耐心些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你前不久刚刚说过，也许我们应该好好“谈一谈”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在监听自救军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的撤退计划会顺利的，请注意，这不是一句讥讽，而是承诺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，初次见面。希望我们的目的并不相悖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰色的礼帽......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很敏锐，伊莎贝尔·孟塔古小姐，不愧是曼彻斯特伯爵家的孩子。人们确实常常称呼我们为“灰礼帽”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如有机会，替我向你的母亲问好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张，孟塔古小姐，我暂时无意与各位为敌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，那边的源石技艺小机关也是你善意的证明？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不习惯在一堆爆炸物旁边和别人聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是以防万一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，以防万一——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收起你的武器，阿斯卡纶小姐，这不值得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗企业罗德岛，以“废旧工业资源回收与处理”的名义申请了一系列通行和停靠许可，现在正躲藏在那位高多汀公爵的控制区域内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距离伦蒂尼姆城六百三十一公里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅小姐，我猜，你们的回收作业还算顺利？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你很了解罗德岛。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"看来，维多利亚的大人物们对我们并不是一无所知。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只做必要的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们很谨慎，你们仔细设计了航道，围绕你们的船搭建了十分隐秘的补给网，你们不希望引起维多利亚的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们几乎就要瞒过我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论动机是善是恶，在统治者眼中，隐瞒是最糟糕的品质，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你为谁服务，“灰礼帽”先生？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有可能的话，我会说我为维多利亚服务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，现实是，我只为部分的维多利亚服务。但光是这部分的维多利亚，就够我忙的啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这么说，你是某位大公爵的人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果威灵顿公爵认为我们是个威胁——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛一定已经遭到进攻。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"温德米尔公爵的掌控力远没有抵达高多汀公爵领境内。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"而诺曼底公爵，我听说，他更喜欢做生意。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"其他几位公爵只不过是墙头草。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你隶属于那位开斯特。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“博士”，罗德岛的指挥官......关于你的资料屈指可数，我们原本以为只是因为你没那么重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于你的内部评级将会上调。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛对你口中的“部分的维多利亚”有什么价值？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们对于一家开展废品回收的“制药”公司没有那么大的兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你们的干员身份很特殊，并且，她拿到了一件很重要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们已经失败了一次，你们还没有放弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的工作，亚历山德莉娜殿下，我们不必相互为难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把剑在你手上只不过是一根笨重的铁条，没有任何用处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你指望用它来干什么？真的切开盘旋于我们头顶的天灾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"故事只是故事罢了，你没办法真正用好它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你们的那位开斯特公爵打算用它来干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"履行承诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承诺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为她的追随者带来和平与安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们确实有一些技术......能让这把剑真正派上用场，就和诸王之息曾庇护过伦蒂尼姆一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵阁下希望这把剑能够成为团结的契机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，不站在你们那一边的人就活该被天灾吞没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，它才能成为那个契机。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（博士，倒数三秒后我会行动，我们必须摆脱如今的局面。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（驻扎在本舰的干员们......他们应该有能力解决好可能发生的危机，我们必须得冒一点险。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（三。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（二。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"气氛很紧张啊，我来的不是时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊内丝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰礼帽”先生，您的准备确实很充分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十三个小型通讯站，其中有四个是被动触发式的，在十分钟内没有收到您的讯息便会自动发布指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想猜测它们会发送什么指令，所以我把它们直接捏碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望您不会责怪我的擅作主张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的那些下属很坚强，他们听到血魔的名字也没有表现失当，不过我相信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了萨卡兹王庭，也有些躲在城里的别人，对他们的存在很感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说，我把他们送去哪里比较合适？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊内丝女士，前萨卡兹雇佣兵......你还活着这件事没那么让人意外。我们早就判断过伦蒂尼姆内的这些小动作有一个主使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以来，你都干得很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们知道有不少萨卡兹雇佣兵正倾向于脱离军事委员会的掌控，但这并不是毫无代价的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的那位合作伙伴，恐怕如今的处境并不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们更直接一点吧，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的手段绝对不止这么一点，你也知道我们还有很多未揭开的底牌。互相试探的环节就此结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的影子告诉我，你在犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，一项交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有个麻烦的任务，但是如你们所见，我不怎么喜欢打架和冒险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你需要些替死鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信各位的本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们一定看到过那架飞空艇，现在它停在那座孤零零的诺伯特区里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接近那里，搞到飞空艇的结构图。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"报酬呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你的伙伴，你的盟友，你的伤员，你的舰船都可以暂时活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这对于维多利亚只是举手之劳，但对于你们嘛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"成交。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[]}
